<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Gabaritando — Carreiras Policiais da Bahia</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,300;1,400;1,600;1,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   TOKENS — Paleta Brandbook V2
═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
:root {
  --ouro:        #FFB800;
  --ouro-escuro: #CC9400;
  --ouro-suave:  rgba(255,184,0,0.12);
  --preto:       #0E0E1A;
  --preto-2:     #13131F;
  --ardosia:     #1E1E2E;
  --carvao:      #111111;
  --creme:       #EDE8DF;
  --creme-2:     #F5F1EB;
  --branco:      #FFFFFF;
  --borda:       rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  --borda-ouro:  rgba(255,184,0,0.22);
  --font:        'Montserrat', sans-serif;
}

*, *::before, *::after { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
html { overflow-x:hidden; scroll-behavior:smooth; }
body {
  background: var(--preto);
  color: var(--branco);
  font-family: var(--font);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}
img { max-width:100%; height:auto; display:block; }
a { text-decoration:none; color:inherit; }

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   LAYOUT
═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
.container { max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 48px; }
.section { padding:80px 0; }

/* Backgrounds sutis com textura */
.bg-preto   { background: var(--preto); }
.bg-preto-2 { background: var(--preto-2); }
.bg-ardosia { background: var(--ardosia); }
.bg-creme   { background: var(--creme); color: var(--carvao); }

.divider {
  width:100%; height:1px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ouro), rgba(255,184,0,0));
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   HEADER FIXO
═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
.top-bar {
  position:fixed; top:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:999;
  background:rgba(14,14,26,0.92);
  backdrop-filter:blur(12px); -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,184,0,0.08);
  padding:0 32px;
  height:56px;
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
}
.top-bar-logo { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; }
.top-bar-logo img { height:28px; width:auto; }
.top-bar-cta {
  background:var(--ouro); color:var(--carvao);
  font-family:var(--font); font-size:0.7rem; font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase;
  padding:8px 22px; transition:opacity .2s;
}
.top-bar-cta:hover { opacity:0.85; }
body { padding-top:56px; }

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   HERO
═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
.hero {
  position:relative;
  min-height:92vh;
  display:flex; align-items:center;
  overflow:hidden;
  padding:80px 0 60px;
}
.hero-bg {
  position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:0;
}
.hero-bg-photo {
  position:absolute; inset:0;
  background-image:url('../02-MARCA/elementos/bg-planos-de-fundo/pm 3.jpeg');
  background-size:cover; background-position:center 30%;
}
.hero-bg-overlay {
  position:absolute; inset:0;
  background: linear-gradient(
    180deg,
    rgba(14,14,26,0.88) 0%,
    rgba(14,14,26,0.75) 40%,
    rgba(14,14,26,0.92) 100%
  );
}
.hero-bg-grid {
  position:absolute; inset:0;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(rgba(255,184,0,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,184,0,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size:60px 60px;
  pointer-events:none;
}
.hero-content {
  position:relative; z-index:2;
  max-width:680px;
}
.hero-badge {
  display:inline-block;
  background:rgba(255,184,0,0.1);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,184,0,0.25);
  color:var(--ouro);
  font-size:0.68rem; font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase;
  padding:6px 18px;
  margin-bottom:28px;
}
.hero h1 {
  font-family:var(--font);
  font-size:3.2rem; font-weight:900;
  line-height:1.08;
  margin-bottom:12px;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  letter-spacing:-0.01em;
}
.hero h1 em {
  font-style:normal;
  color:var(--ouro);
  display:block;
}
.hero-sub {
  font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:300;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
  line-height:1.7;
  margin-bottom:36px;
  max-width:540px;
}
.hero-sub strong { color:var(--ouro); font-weight:600; }
.hero-cta-group { display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; }

/* Botoes */
.btn {
  display:inline-block;
  font-family:var(--font); font-size:0.78rem; font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase;
  padding:15px 36px;
  transition:all .25s;
  cursor:pointer; border:none;
  text-align:center;
}
.btn-gold {
  background:var(--ouro); color:var(--carvao);
}
.btn-gold:hover { background:#FFD060; }
.btn-outline {
  background:transparent; color:var(--ouro);
  border:1px solid var(--ouro);
}
.btn-outline:hover { background:rgba(255,184,0,0.08); }

/* Seta decorativa no hero */
.hero-photo-side {
  position:absolute; right:-20px; bottom:0; z-index:1;
  width:420px; height:100%;
  display:flex; align-items:flex-end; justify-content:flex-end;
  pointer-events:none;
}
.hero-photo-side img {
  height:85%; width:auto; object-fit:contain;
  filter:drop-shadow(0 0 80px rgba(255,184,0,0.08));
  opacity:0.15;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   NUMEROS / PROVA SOCIAL RAPIDA
═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
.numbers-bar {
  background:var(--ouro);
  padding:0;
}
.numbers-grid {
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
  text-align:center;
}
.number-item {
  padding:28px 16px;
  border-right:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}
.number-item:last-child { border-right:none; }
.number-big {
  font-family:var(--font); font-size:2.2rem; font-weight:900;
  color:var(--carvao); line-height:1;
  margin-bottom:4px;
}
.number-label {
  font-size:0.72rem; font-weight:500;
  color:rgba(0,0,0,0.6); letter-spacing:0.06em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   SEÇOES GERAIS
═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
.section-label {
  font-size:0.64rem; font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:0.4em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--ouro); margin-bottom:14px;
}
.section-title {
  font-family:var(--font); font-size:2.4rem;
  font-weight:800; line-height:1.12;
  margin-bottom:20px;
}
.section-title em { font-style:italic; color:var(--ouro); font-weight:800; }
.section-intro {
  font-size:0.95rem; font-weight:300;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
  max-width:620px; line-height:1.8;
  margin-bottom:48px;
}
.section-intro.dark { color:rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   CURSOS — Grid de produtos
═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
.courses-grid {
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:20px;
}
.course-card {
  border:1px solid var(--borda-ouro);
  overflow:hidden;
  background:var(--preto-2);
  transition:border-color .3s;
}
.course-card:hover { border-color:var(--ouro); }
.course-img {
  height:200px;
  background-size:cover; background-position:center;
  position:relative;
}
.course-img::after {
  content:'';
  position:absolute; inset:0;
  background:linear-gradient(to top, rgba(14,14,26,0.9) 0%, transparent 60%);
}
.course-body {
  padding:22px 20px;
  position:relative;
}
.course-tag {
  font-size:0.6rem; font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--ouro); margin-bottom:8px;
}
.course-name {
  font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:700;
  margin-bottom:6px; line-height:1.25;
}
.course-price {
  font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:300;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
}
.course-price strong {
  font-weight:700; color:var(--ouro); font-size:1.1rem;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   BENEFICIOS
═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
.benefits-layout {
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:48px;
  align-items:start;
}
.benefit-list { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0; }
.benefit-item {
  display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:16px;
  padding:20px 0;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--borda);
}
.benefit-item:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
.benefit-num {
  font-family:var(--font); font-size:1.6rem; font-weight:900;
  color:rgba(255,184,0,0.2); flex-shrink:0;
  line-height:1; min-width:36px;
}
.benefit-text h4 {
  font-size:0.92rem; font-weight:700;
  margin-bottom:4px; color:var(--branco);
}
.benefit-text p {
  font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:300;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); line-height:1.65;
}
.benefits-visual {
  position:relative;
  background:var(--ardosia);
  border:1px solid var(--borda-ouro);
  padding:32px;
  display:flex; flex-direction:column;
  align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  min-height:480px;
}
.benefits-visual img {
  max-width:85%;
  filter:drop-shadow(0 20px 60px rgba(255,184,0,0.08));
}
.benefits-visual-label {
  margin-top:20px;
  font-size:0.68rem; font-weight:600;
  letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:rgba(255,184,0,0.5);
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   MENTORES
═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
.mentors-grid {
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:32px;
}
.mentor-card {
  border:1px solid var(--borda-ouro);
  overflow:hidden;
  background:var(--preto-2);
}
.mentor-photo {
  height:380px;
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
  display:flex; align-items:flex-end; justify-content:center;
}
.mentor-photo-bg {
  position:absolute; inset:0;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg, var(--ardosia) 0%, var(--preto) 100%);
}
.mentor-photo img {
  position:relative; z-index:1;
  height:340px; width:auto; object-fit:contain;
  filter:drop-shadow(0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.4));
}
.mentor-photo-gradient {
  position:absolute; bottom:0; left:0; right:0; height:50%;
  background:linear-gradient(to top, var(--preto-2), transparent);
  z-index:2;
}
.mentor-body { padding:28px 24px; }
.mentor-name {
  font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:800;
  color:var(--ouro); margin-bottom:6px;
  text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.04em;
}
.mentor-role {
  font-size:0.72rem; font-weight:600;
  letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
  margin-bottom:16px;
}
.mentor-creds { list-style:none; padding:0; }
.mentor-creds li {
  padding:8px 0 8px 18px;
  font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:300;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--borda);
  position:relative;
  line-height:1.55;
}
.mentor-creds li:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
.mentor-creds li::before {
  content:'';
  position:absolute; left:0; top:14px;
  width:6px; height:6px;
  background:var(--ouro);
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   DEPOIMENTOS
═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
.testimonials-grid {
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:16px;
}
.testimonial-card {
  border:1px solid var(--borda);
  background:var(--ardosia);
  padding:28px 24px;
  position:relative;
}
.testimonial-card::before {
  content:'\201C';
  font-family:var(--font); font-size:3.5rem;
  font-weight:900; color:rgba(255,184,0,0.1);
  position:absolute; top:8px; left:16px; line-height:1;
}
.testimonial-text {
  font-size:0.86rem; font-weight:300;
  font-style:italic;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
  line-height:1.7;
  margin-bottom:16px;
  position:relative; z-index:1;
}
.testimonial-author {
  font-size:0.72rem; font-weight:700;
  color:var(--ouro); letter-spacing:0.08em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
}
.testimonial-role {
  font-size:0.66rem; font-weight:300;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
  margin-top:2px;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   BIG IDEA / TESE
═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
.thesis-box {
  border:1px solid var(--ouro);
  background:rgba(255,184,0,0.03);
  padding:56px 48px;
  text-align:center;
  position:relative;
}
.thesis-box::before {
  content:'TESE CENTRAL';
  position:absolute; top:0; left:50%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
  background:var(--ouro); color:var(--carvao);
  font-size:0.6rem; font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:0.3em; text-transform:uppercase;
  padding:5px 20px;
}
.thesis-text {
  font-family:var(--font);
  font-size:1.8rem; font-weight:400;
  line-height:1.35;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
}
.thesis-text em {
  font-style:italic; color:var(--ouro); font-weight:700;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   OFERTA / PREÇOS
═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
.pricing-grid {
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:20px;
}
.price-card {
  border:1px solid var(--borda-ouro);
  background:var(--preto-2);
  padding:32px 24px;
  text-align:center;
  transition:border-color .3s, transform .3s;
  position:relative;
}
.price-card:hover { border-color:var(--ouro); transform:translateY(-4px); }
.price-card.featured {
  border-color:var(--ouro);
  background:rgba(255,184,0,0.04);
}
.price-card.featured::before {
  content:'MAIS ESCOLHIDO';
  position:absolute; top:0; left:50%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
  background:var(--ouro); color:var(--carvao);
  font-size:0.58rem; font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase;
  padding:4px 16px; white-space:nowrap;
}
.price-tag {
  font-size:0.62rem; font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--ouro); margin-bottom:20px;
}
.price-value {
  font-family:var(--font); font-size:2.6rem; font-weight:900;
  color:var(--branco); line-height:1; margin-bottom:4px;
}
.price-value sup { font-size:1rem; font-weight:700; vertical-align:top; margin-right:2px; }
.price-installment {
  font-size:0.78rem; font-weight:300;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  margin-bottom:24px;
}
.price-features { list-style:none; padding:0; text-align:left; margin-bottom:28px; }
.price-features li {
  padding:8px 0 8px 20px;
  font-size:0.8rem; font-weight:300;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--borda);
  position:relative; line-height:1.5;
}
.price-features li:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
.price-features li::before {
  content:'\2713';
  position:absolute; left:0; top:8px;
  color:var(--ouro); font-weight:700; font-size:0.75rem;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   GARANTIA
═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
.guarantee-box {
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto 1fr; gap:40px;
  align-items:center;
  border:1px solid var(--borda-ouro);
  background:rgba(255,184,0,0.02);
  padding:48px 40px;
}
.guarantee-seal {
  width:140px; height:140px;
  border:3px solid var(--ouro);
  border-radius:50%;
  display:flex; flex-direction:column;
  align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  text-align:center;
  flex-shrink:0;
}
.guarantee-days {
  font-family:var(--font); font-size:2.8rem;
  font-weight:900; color:var(--ouro); line-height:1;
}
.guarantee-days-label {
  font-size:0.6rem; font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:0.15em; text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--ouro); margin-top:2px;
}
.guarantee-title {
  font-size:1.3rem; font-weight:700;
  margin-bottom:12px; line-height:1.3;
}
.guarantee-text {
  font-size:0.88rem; font-weight:300;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
  line-height:1.8;
}
.guarantee-text strong { color:var(--ouro); font-weight:600; }

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   FAQ
═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
.faq-list { max-width:760px; margin:0 auto; }
.faq-item {
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--borda);
  padding:22px 0;
}
.faq-q {
  font-size:0.95rem; font-weight:600;
  color:var(--branco); cursor:pointer;
  display:flex; justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:center; gap:16px;
}
.faq-q::after {
  content:'+';
  font-size:1.3rem; font-weight:300;
  color:var(--ouro); flex-shrink:0;
  transition:transform .3s;
}
.faq-q.open::after { content:'\2212'; }
.faq-a {
  max-height:0; overflow:hidden;
  transition:max-height .4s ease, padding .3s;
  padding-top:0;
}
.faq-a.open {
  max-height:300px;
  padding-top:14px;
}
.faq-a p {
  font-size:0.84rem; font-weight:300;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
  line-height:1.75;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   CTA FINAL
═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
.final-cta {
  text-align:center;
  padding:80px 0;
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
}
.final-cta-glow {
  position:absolute; width:500px; height:500px;
  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,184,0,0.06) 0%,transparent 70%);
  top:50%; left:50%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
  pointer-events:none;
}
.final-cta h2 {
  font-size:2.4rem; font-weight:900;
  text-transform:uppercase; line-height:1.1;
  margin-bottom:12px;
  position:relative;
}
.final-cta h2 em { font-style:normal; color:var(--ouro); }
.final-cta p {
  font-size:0.95rem; font-weight:300;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
  margin-bottom:36px;
  position:relative;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   FOOTER
═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
.footer {
  border-top:1px solid var(--borda);
  padding:40px 0;
}
.footer-inner {
  display:flex; align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:20px;
}
.footer-brand { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; }
.footer-brand img { height:32px; width:auto; }
.footer-brand-text {
  font-size:0.72rem; font-weight:300;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
  letter-spacing:0.06em;
}
.footer-legal {
  font-size:0.64rem;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
  letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   RESPONSIVO
═══════════════════════════════════════════ */
@media (max-width:900px) {
  .container { padding:0 28px; }
  .hero h1 { font-size:2.4rem; }
  .hero-photo-side { display:none; }
  .numbers-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); }
  .courses-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; }
  .benefits-layout { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .benefits-visual { min-height:300px; }
  .mentors-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; max-width:480px; margin:0 auto; }
  .testimonials-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; }
  .pricing-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; max-width:400px; margin:0 auto; }
  .guarantee-box { grid-template-columns:1fr; text-align:center; justify-items:center; }
  .section-title { font-size:1.9rem; }
  .thesis-text { font-size:1.4rem; }
  .final-cta h2 { font-size:1.9rem; }
}

@media (max-width:600px) {
  .container { padding:0 18px; }
  .top-bar { padding:0 16px; }
  .top-bar-logo img { height:22px; }
  .top-bar-cta { font-size:0.62rem; padding:7px 14px; }

  .hero { min-height:auto; padding:48px 0 40px; }
  .hero h1 { font-size:1.75rem; }
  .hero-sub { font-size:0.95rem; }
  .hero-badge { font-size:0.6rem; padding:5px 12px; margin-bottom:20px; }
  .hero-cta-group { flex-direction:column; }
  .hero-cta-group .btn { width:100%; text-align:center; }

  .section { padding:56px 0; }
  .section-label { font-size:0.58rem; letter-spacing:0.3em; }
  .section-title { font-size:1.5rem; }
  .section-intro { font-size:0.88rem; margin-bottom:32px; }

  .numbers-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; }
  .number-big { font-size:1.6rem; }
  .number-label { font-size:0.62rem; }
  .number-item { padding:20px 12px; }

  .courses-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .course-img { height:160px; }

  .benefit-num { font-size:1.2rem; min-width:28px; }
  .benefit-item { gap:12px; padding:16px 0; }

  .mentor-photo { height:300px; }
  .mentor-photo img { height:260px; }
  .mentor-body { padding:22px 18px; }
  .mentor-name { font-size:1.05rem; }

  .testimonials-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }

  .thesis-box { padding:40px 22px; }
  .thesis-text { font-size:1.15rem; }

  .pricing-grid { max-width:100%; }
  .price-value { font-size:2.2rem; }

  .guarantee-box { padding:32px 22px; gap:24px; }
  .guarantee-seal { width:110px; height:110px; }
  .guarantee-days { font-size:2.2rem; }
  .guarantee-title { font-size:1.1rem; }
  .guarantee-text { font-size:0.82rem; }

  .faq-q { font-size:0.88rem; }

  .final-cta h2 { font-size:1.5rem; }
  .final-cta { padding:56px 0; }

  .footer-inner { flex-direction:column; text-align:center; }

  .btn { font-size:0.72rem; padding:14px 24px; }
}

@media (max-width:400px) {
  .hero h1 { font-size:1.45rem; }
  .section-title { font-size:1.3rem; }
  .number-big { font-size:1.4rem; }
  .container { padding:0 14px; }
}

</style>
</head>
<body>


<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     HEADER FIXO
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="top-bar">
  <div class="top-bar-logo">
    <img src="../02-MARCA/logos/02_AVATAR_1000X1000PX-removebg-preview.png" alt="Gabaritando">
    <span style="font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.06em;color:var(--ouro)">GABARITANDO</span>
  </div>
  <a href="#oferta" class="top-bar-cta">Quero me preparar</a>
</div>


<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     HERO
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg">
    <div class="hero-bg-photo"></div>
    <div class="hero-bg-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-bg-grid"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:48px;position:relative;z-index:2">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-badge">Carreiras Policiais da Bahia</div>
      <h1>
        Treinado para<br>a Bahia.
        <em>Aprovado de verdade.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        O preparat&oacute;rio criado por quem foi aprovado como <strong>Soldado e Oficial da PMBA</strong>.
        M&eacute;todo exclusivo para quem quer vestir a farda na Bahia &mdash; com aulas, cronograma personalizado
        e banco de quest&otilde;es alinhado ao perfil da banca.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta-group">
        <a href="#oferta" class="btn btn-gold">Quero garantir minha vaga</a>
        <a href="#metodo" class="btn btn-outline">Conhecer o metodo</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Foto do mentor no hero (desktop) -->
  <div class="hero-photo-side">
    <img src="IMG_1237-removebg.png" alt="Alan Nascimento">
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     BARRA DE NUMEROS
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="numbers-bar">
  <div class="container" style="padding:0">
    <div class="numbers-grid">
      <div class="number-item">
        <div class="number-big">5</div>
        <div class="number-label">Concursos atendidos</div>
      </div>
      <div class="number-item">
        <div class="number-big">3.000+</div>
        <div class="number-label">Vagas previstas BA 2026</div>
      </div>
      <div class="number-item">
        <div class="number-big">12</div>
        <div class="number-label">Meses de acesso</div>
      </div>
      <div class="number-item">
        <div class="number-big">100%</div>
        <div class="number-label">Focado na Bahia</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     TESE CENTRAL
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section bg-preto-2">
<div class="container">
  <div class="thesis-box">
    <p class="thesis-text">
      Nao e a falta de estudo que reprova o candidato baiano.<br>
      E estudar sem saber <em>o que a Bahia cobra.</em>
    </p>
  </div>
  <p style="text-align:center;font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:300;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);margin-top:20px;max-width:560px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;line-height:1.7">
    Enquanto os grandes cursos nacionais ensinam para um concurso generico, o candidato da PMBA, do BMBA e da PCBA enfrenta uma banca especifica, com perfil proprio de cobranca. O Gabaritando existe para corrigir esse desvio.
  </p>
</div>
</section>

<div class="divider"></div>


<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     CURSOS
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section bg-preto" id="cursos">
<div class="container">
  <div class="section-label">Preparacao completa</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Escolha o <em>seu concurso</em></h2>
  <p class="section-intro">
    Selecione a carreira policial que voce quer seguir. Cada curso foi construido sob medida para o perfil da banca e o conteudo programatico do concurso.
  </p>

  <div class="courses-grid">

    <div class="course-card">
      <div class="course-img" style="background-image:url('../02-MARCA/elementos/bg-ads/ad_bg_1.jpg')"></div>
      <div class="course-body">
        <div class="course-tag">PMBA &amp; BMBA</div>
        <div class="course-name">Soldado PM e BM</div>
        <div class="course-price">A partir de <strong>12x R$ 79</strong></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="course-card">
      <div class="course-img" style="background-image:url('../02-MARCA/elementos/bg-ads/ad_bg_2.jpg')"></div>
      <div class="course-body">
        <div class="course-tag">PMBA &amp; BMBA</div>
        <div class="course-name">Oficial PM e BM (CFO)</div>
        <div class="course-price">A partir de <strong>12x R$ 100</strong></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="course-card">
      <div class="course-img" style="background-image:url('../02-MARCA/elementos/bg-ads/ad_bg_3.jpg')"></div>
      <div class="course-body">
        <div class="course-tag">Policia Civil</div>
        <div class="course-name">Investigador PCBA</div>
        <div class="course-price">A partir de <strong>12x R$ 79</strong></div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
</section>

<div class="divider"></div>


<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     BENEFICIOS / METODO
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section bg-preto-2" id="metodo">
<div class="container">
  <div class="section-label">Sistema GABA</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">O que voce <em>recebe</em></h2>
  <p class="section-intro">Nao sao apenas videoaulas. E um sistema completo de preparacao calibrado para o concurso que voce vai fazer.</p>

  <div class="benefits-layout">

    <div class="benefit-list">
      <div class="benefit-item">
        <div class="benefit-num">01</div>
        <div class="benefit-text">
          <h4>Curso 100% focado na sua prova</h4>
          <p>Conteudo alinhado ao edital e ao perfil da banca do seu concurso. Nada generico, nada de fora da Bahia.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit-item">
        <div class="benefit-num">02</div>
        <div class="benefit-text">
          <h4>Cronograma personalizado</h4>
          <p>Gerador automatico que adapta a trilha de estudos a sua rotina. Trabalha e estuda? O cronograma se ajusta.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit-item">
        <div class="benefit-num">03</div>
        <div class="benefit-text">
          <h4>Metodo validado: Teoria + Questoes + Revisao</h4>
          <p>Cada modulo combina aula, treino por questoes comentadas e revisao ciclica. Sem achismo.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit-item">
        <div class="benefit-num">04</div>
        <div class="benefit-text">
          <h4>Banco de questoes da banca</h4>
          <p>Questoes organizadas por materia, assunto e nivel, alinhadas ao historico de cobranca dos concursos baianos.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit-item">
        <div class="benefit-num">05</div>
        <div class="benefit-text">
          <h4>Simulados exclusivos com correcao</h4>
          <p>Simulados no formato real da prova. Voce treina nas mesmas condicoes do dia do concurso.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit-item">
        <div class="benefit-num">06</div>
        <div class="benefit-text">
          <h4>Professores que sao policiais</h4>
          <p>Aprenda com quem vive a rotina da farda. Professores aprovados nos proprios concursos que voce vai prestar.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="benefit-item">
        <div class="benefit-num">07</div>
        <div class="benefit-text">
          <h4>Suporte direto com os mentores</h4>
          <p>Grupo exclusivo de alunos com acesso aos fundadores. Suas duvidas respondidas por quem ja passou.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="benefits-visual">
      <img src="../03-CRIATIVOS/carrossel/CARROSSEL-1.1.png" alt="Plataforma Gabaritando">
      <div class="benefits-visual-label">Plataforma Gabaritando</div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
</section>

<div class="divider"></div>


<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     MENTORES
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section bg-preto" id="mentores">
<div class="container">
  <div class="section-label">Seus professores</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Criado por quem <em>ja passou</em></h2>
  <p class="section-intro">O Gabaritando foi fundado por dois Oficiais da PMBA que percorreram o caminho completo: do concurso de Soldado ao Curso de Formacao de Oficiais. Eles nao ensinam teoria &mdash; ensinam o que funciona.</p>

  <div class="mentors-grid">

    <!-- ALAN -->
    <div class="mentor-card">
      <div class="mentor-photo">
        <div class="mentor-photo-bg"></div>
        <img src="IMG_1237-removebg.png" alt="Alan Nascimento">
        <div class="mentor-photo-gradient"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="mentor-body">
        <div class="mentor-name">Alan Nascimento</div>
        <div class="mentor-role">Fundador &amp; Professor</div>
        <ul class="mentor-creds">
          <li>Mestrando em Seguranca Publica, Justica e Cidadania &mdash; UFBA</li>
