    <p style="font-size:0.84rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);font-weight:300;margin-bottom:12px">Disciplinas especificas &mdash; Soldado PMBA e CBMBA</p>
    <div class="price-value" style="font-size:1.8rem"><sup>R$</sup>147</div>
